Transport of MPs in soil
The transport behaviors and driving mechanism of MPs in soil exhibit considerable diverse. These particles not only migrate within the soil matrix but also transition to other environmental media (water and air) and living organisms through multiple mechanisms (Yang et al., 2024; Sajjad et al., 2022; Xu et al., 2020). Soil MPs are transported to rivers, lakes, and other terrestrial water bodies via runoff, ultimately reaching the oceans (Nematollahi et al., 2022; Nizzetto et al., 2016).
